        "hi": "गरीब परिवार (BPL / AAY कार्ड, या SC / ST परिवार)"
      },
      "source": {
        "title": "PMUY eligibility summary",
        "url": "https://www.iasgyan.in/daily-current-affairs/pradhan-mantri-ujjwala-yojana-pmuy-transforming-womens-health-clean-energy-access",
